@startuml Feature1_Seq_2
skinparam maxMessageSize 150
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam minClassWidth 100

title **Feature 1: Recruitment Request Management - Sequence: Convert Request to Job**

actor Recruiter
participant "Recruiter UI" as UI
participant "<<controller>>\nRecruitmentRequestController" as Ctrl
participant "<<service>>\nRecruitmentRequestService" as Svc
participant "<<repository>>\nRecruitmentRequestRepo" as Repo
participant "<<repository>>\nJobRepository" as JobRepo
participant "<<entity>>\nRecruitmentRequest" as Entity
participant "<<dbcontext>>\nAppDbContext" as DbContext
participant "Database" as DB

Recruiter -> UI: Select Request & Convert to Job
activate UI

note right of UI: UI calls Job API to create Job first,\nthen links JobId to Request

UI -> Ctrl: POST /api/recruitment-requests/{id}/convert (jobId)
activate Ctrl

Ctrl -> Svc: ConvertAsync(requestId, dto)
activate Svc

Svc -> Repo: GetByIdAsync(requestId)
activate Repo
Repo -> DbContext: Query Request
activate DbContext
DbContext -> DB: SELECT
activate DB
DB --> DbContext: Data
deactivate DB
DbContext --> Repo: Data
deactivate DbContext
Repo --> Svc: return Request object
deactivate Repo

Svc -> JobRepo: GetByIdAsync(jobId)
activate JobRepo
JobRepo --> Svc: return Job object
deactivate JobRepo

Svc -> Svc: Update Status="CONVERTED"
Svc -> Svc: Link JobId to Request

Svc -> Repo: SaveAsync()
activate Repo
Repo -> DbContext: SaveChangesAsync()
activate DbContext
DbContext -> DB: Execute SQL UPDATE
activate DB
DB --> DbContext: success
deactivate DB
DbContext --> Repo: success
deactivate DbContext
Repo --> Svc: success
deactivate Repo

Svc --> Ctrl: return RecruitmentRequestDto
deactivate Svc

Ctrl --> UI: return JSON data
deactivate Ctrl

UI --> Recruiter: Display success message
deactivate UI
@enduml
